# Canonical development

Trace the full call chain before changing behavior. Reuse canonical owners:
`lib/bookkeeping/engine.ts`, `lib/platform/entitlements.ts`,
`lib/year-end/access.ts`, `lib/import`, `lib/reports` and their database RPCs.
Migrate callers and remove competing business logic. Frontend must not
recalculate ledger, entitlement, report or import decisions.
